How do API'S relate to web services??

API is an way to let software components talk to each other
The way an API is implemented and what it consits of is NOT important 
Web services are a set of rules and technologies that enable two or more components on the web to talk to each  other

so, WEB SERVICES ARE JUST API'S BUT ALL API'S ARE NOT WEB SERVICES

REST API = REST WEB SERVICES

WHAT IS A REST API OR REST WEB SERVICES??

-> A Rest API is an API that follows the rules of REST specification 

REST 
-> REpresentational State Transfer
It is a specification that dictates how distributed systems on the web should communicate.
REST Is an way to implement and use the HTTP Protocol.

